<section class="ref-group"><h2>Battles <span class="n">39</span></h2><ul class="enc-list"><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-tinchebray"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/battle-of-tinchebray.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Tinchebray</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1106</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Tinchebray was fought on 28 September 1106 in south-western Normandy between Henry I of England and his elder brother Robert Curthose, duke of Normandy.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-ucles-1108"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/battle-of-ucles-1108.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Uclés (1108)</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1108</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Uclés was fought on 29 May 1108 near Uclés in central Spain.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-valtierra"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Valtierra</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1110</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Valtierra was fought on 24 January 1110 near Valtierra in Navarre, Spain.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-ningjiang"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Ningjiang</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1114</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Ningjiang was fought in 1114 when the Jurchen chieftain Wanyan Aguda rebelled against the Liao dynasty and attacked its fortress of Ningjiang in Manchuria.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-hubudagang"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Hubudagang</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1115</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Hubudagang was fought in 1115 in Manchuria between the Jurchen leader Wanyan Aguda, newly proclaimed emperor of the Jin dynasty, and the Liao emperor…</span><